  steps: [
    { math: '1 · Epidemiology: who gets what, where, when', note: 'The detective division of medicine — studying disease patterns in POPULATIONS. Snow\'s cholera map (1854) founded it: plotting cases fingered one water pump, decades before the germ theory existed.' },
    { math: '2 · Measures that drive decisions', note: 'Incidence (new cases), prevalence (all cases), mortality rate, R₀. Each answers a different question — is the outbreak growing, how big is the burden, how fast does it spread?' },
